        "content": "## Exercise\n\n**TASK:**\n- Modify the `Add to Price` Set Node so that it calculates the tax on the price (assume 7% tax rate)\n- Connect the Get Price node to the Add to Price node\n- (Optional) Add an additional Set Node which transforms the type of the Price to a `String` and add a `$` before it (ex. `100` becomes `$100`.\n\n**SUCCESS**\n✓ A price of `100` becomes `107`\n✓ (Optional) `107` becomes `$107`",
