      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Node Connection Line\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n* Passes data from one node to the next\n* Defines the execution order of the workflow\n* Ensures each step receives input from the previous one\n* One node can be connected to multiple nodes\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\n1. Click and drag from the small circle on one node to another\n2. Release to create a connection\n3. Data output from the first node becomes input for the next\n\nEach data field has a specific data type which can be transformed as you move through the workflow.\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Passing data from one node to another\n* Transforming data and data types\n",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d6e9d805-204d-4d4d-9321-ae10a7d0ecb0",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        976,
        -800
      ]
    },
