      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lists of items (n8n-iterables)\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n| In n8n,\n| all data passed between nodes\n| is an array of objects.\n| [n8n docs](https://docs.n8n.io/data/data-structure/)\n\n* n8n passes data **in the form of a list of objects** from one node to the next\n* Each node handles the list of items (not just one)\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\nNo change. n8n does this for you automatically!\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Handling many items seamlessly",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 380,
